GNAT runtime patch licensing and provenance

The files in this directory contain patch context derived from the GNAT
runtime sources distributed as part of GCC, principally GNARL units from
gcc/ada/libgnarl. They are licensed under:

    GPL-3.0-or-later WITH GCC-exception-3.1

The complete license terms are published by the GNU Project:

    GNU General Public License version 3
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

    GCC Runtime Library Exception version 3.1
    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gcc-exception-3.1.html

Flyology does not redistribute complete GNAT runtime source files. The build
script applies these patches to sources copied from the user's installed GNAT
toolchain.
